{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/c5792e9b813d83d15e75e3e4f625c1af.avif?t=1752857920\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/BookGifSpookyAhh.gif?t=1752857920\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to your first week working at The E.I.D.O.L.O.N. Institute, an organisation founded to combat the growing number of haunted objects created from the cataclysm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's your job to use the provided tools around you to uncover clues. Try holding the object under a UV Blacklight, scanning the EMF Rating, or just smacking it with a Silver Hammer to see if it does anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/24100f7e5ce2003b5b78f7cf8c317d1a.avif?t=1752857920\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.poster.avif?t=1752857920\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.webm?t=1752857920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.mp4?t=1752857920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mark the results on your clipboard to figure out what is haunting your object and correctly send them down the chute to progress through your shifts.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/3b7dd392e594da1c8fbeb7f984e86ddd.avif?t=1752857920\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5f5d94f30a5197df45.poster.avif?t=1752857920\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5f5d94f30a5197df45.webm?t=1752857920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5f5d94f30a5197df45.mp4?t=1752857920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job does come with a slight risk... Rumour has it that the more time you spend working at the institute, the more your mind will lose sight of what is real. Fend off your hallucinations and hold onto reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make it to the end of the week without getting fired or going insane, and you might get yourself a pretty paycheck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669400?t=1752857920","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/3f37311f92fd71ec867e9414e30a3784c307f96a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752857920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/fca75308bf3dc3cd86d6210fc062a131b8a94a27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752857920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/fca75308bf3dc3cd86d6210fc062a131b8a94a27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752857920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"While A Spooky Item Game does not force the player to interact with any mature themes, such as suicide, legal drugs, or violence, there are references to these topics within the game in the form of the objects randomly presented to you. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/c5792e9b813d83d15e75e3e4f625c1af.avif?t=1752857920\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/BookGifSpookyAhh.gif?t=1752857920\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to your first week working at The E.I.D.O.L.O.N. Institute, an organisation founded to combat the growing number of haunted objects created from the cataclysm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's your job to use the provided tools around you to uncover clues. Try holding the object under a UV Blacklight, scanning the EMF Rating, or just smacking it with a Silver Hammer to see if it does anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/24100f7e5ce2003b5b78f7cf8c317d1a.avif?t=1752857920\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.poster.avif?t=1752857920\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.webm?t=1752857920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.mp4?t=1752857920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mark the results on your clipboard to figure out what is haunting your object and correctly send them down the chute to progress through your shifts.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/3b7dd392e594da1c8fbeb7f984e86ddd.avif?t=1752857920\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5f5d94f30a5197df45.poster.avif?t=1752857920\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5f5d94f30a5197df45.webm?t=1752857920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5f5d94f30a5197df45.mp4?t=1752857920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job does come with a slight risk... Rumour has it that the more time you spend working at the institute, the more your mind will lose sight of what is real. Fend off your hallucinations and hold onto reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make it to the end of the week without getting fired or going insane, and you might get yourself a pretty paycheck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Fralf Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"In